// bolton.yarn

title: Bolton
---
<<if $setting == "Motel">>
    <<jump Bolton_Motel>>
<<elseif $setting == "boltons_office">>
    <<jump Bolton_Office>>
<<elseif $setting == "Greenroom">>
    <<jump Bolton_Greenroom>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Bolton_Motel
---
<<if $is_asleep>>
    <<jump Bolton_Motel_DuringSleep>>
<<elseif $motel_evidence == 0>>
    Bolton: Sink? Dead Woman? I'm sure you can do better than that.
    You: You're right, you're right, let me take my time.
<<elseif $motel_evidence < 5>>
    <<jump Bolton_Motel_SomeEvidence>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Bolton_Motel_AllEvidence>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Bolton_Motel_DuringSleep
//setting: motel, gibbs asleep
---
Bolton: Anything to report?

You: ...

Bolton: Hello?
===

title: Bolton_Motel_SomeEvidence
//setting: motel, gibbs awakened
---
Bolton: Anything to report?

You: Yes, I got some evidence

Bolton: Some? Do you know what happened here?

You: I'm not sure yet.

Bolton: Alright. Let me know if you need to head to the station before coming back.

-> I'll stick around.
    <<set $motel_active = false>>
    Bolton: Alright, your call.
-> Let's head back to the Station.
    <<transitionTo Station>>
    Bolton: OK, let's head out.
===

title: Bolton_Motel_AllEvidence
//setting: motel, gibbs awakened
---
Bolton: Anything to report?

You: Yes, I think I gathered all the evidence I need.

Bolton: Good work, ready to head back to the department?

-> Yes.
    <<set $motel_active = false>>
    <<transitionTo Station>>
-> Hold that thought.
    Bolton: Let me know when you're ready to head back.
    You: Okay.
===

title: Bolton_Office
---
<<if $bolton_office_visited == false>>
    <<set $bolton_office_visited = true>>
    <<jump Bolton_Office_FirstVisit>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Bolton_Office_Loop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Bolton_Office_FirstVisit
//setting: bolton's office with LT. Bolton
---
Bolton: You know Gibbs for a second there at the Motel it felt like hiring you might've been a mistake.

Bolton: But then you proved my original hunch to hire you on correctly.

Bolton: Anyhow what'd you come in for?

<<jump Bolton_Office_Loop>>
===

title: Bolton_Office_Loop
//setting: bolton's office with LT. Bolton
---
Bolton: Yes Gibbs?

<<if ($bradshaw_complete_motel && $motel_report_submitted == false) || ($bradshaw_complete_greenroom && $greenroom_report_submitted == false) || $motel_active || $greenroom_active>>
    -> You: Here's the full report <<if $bradshaw_complete_motel && $motel_report_submitted == false>>
        You: Here's the full report
        // You explain to Bolton everything from your notepad along with the evidence processed by Bradshaw
        Bolton: Good work. I'll look for family or friends of the victim, with any luck someone might be able to help I.D. our killer.
        <<set $motel_report_submitted = true>>
    -> You: Here's the full report <<if $bradshaw_complete_greenroom && $greenroom_report_submitted == false>>
        You: Here's the full report
        // You explain to Bolton everything from your notepad along with the evidence processed by Bradshaw
        Bolton: Really you think it's him? We'll call the bass guitarist into questioning
        <<set $greenroom_report_submitted = true>>
    -> I need a ride. <<if $motel_active || $greenroom_active>>
        <<jump Bolton_Transportation>>
<<else>>
    You: Uhh, nothing.
<<endif>>
===

title: Bolton_Transportation
//setting: bolton's office with LT. Bolton
---
Bolton: Where to?

-> Motel <<if $motel_active>>
    <<transitionTo Motel>>
-> Greenroom <<if $greenroom_active>>
    <<transitionTo Greenroom>>
===

title: Bolton_Greenroom
---
<<if $is_asleep>>
    <<jump Bolton_Greenroom_Asleep>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Bolton_Greenroom_Awake>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Bolton_Greenroom_Awake
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
Bolton: Anything yet?

-> Not yet.
-> I think I have what I need. <<if $greenroom_evidence > 0>>
    Bolton: Good work, ready to head back to the department?
    -> Yes.
        <<set $greenroom_active = false>>
        <<transitionTo Station>>
    -> Hold that thought.
        Bolton: Let me know when you're ready to head back.
        You: Okay.
===

title: Bolton_Greenroom_Asleep
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
Bolton: Anything Yet?

You: ...
===